/*
 * One product line per row: category, supplier (1-based), model code, name,
 * unit cost, list price, unit, photo shape, colours, sizes, network demand
 * (units a day across every size and colour) and the order quantity a shop
 * usually asks for. Every colour × size is a SKU.
 */
/* What a product of a category is specified by (the attribute table): a
   buyer adds a row and every product of that category has the field. A row
   with no category is a field every product has. Values live in
   product.specs, one JSON object per product. */
